post.description:
Call after login/registration with the guest token. Lines with the same product and
add-ons are combined and capped by stock; unavailable products (or add-ons) are dropped;
the guest cart is deleted.

PlaceOrderRequest.description:
Checkout. The items, prices and totals come from the customer's server-side cart;
any price or total sent here is ignored.

Delivery needs either `address_id` (a saved address) or an inline `address`, not both.
